      "kind": "implementable_seam",
      "text": "Arena slot peaks and pending-handle history are needed; live count alone cannot bound Clone."
    },
    {
      "id": "BC005-02",
      "kind": "public_api_limit",
      "text": "Bvh heap_memory_size is approximate, omits Option payload width in leaf-map term and excludes BroadPhase workspace/pairs."
    },
    {
      "id": "BC005-03",
      "kind": "implementable_seam",
      "text": "Wrapper cumulative broad-phase events.len bounds pair insertion history; pinned hashbrown growth derives conservative retained bucket/layout bound."
    },
    {
      "id": "BC005-04",
      "kind": "scoped_invariant",
      "text": "Island/NarrowPhase/joint dynamic payloads remain empty under current private production wrapper methods; joint arenas still contain four Free entries each."
    },
    {
      "id": "BC005-05",
      "kind": "remaining_limit",
      "text": "Exact native bytes for private Arena Entry<T> cannot be claimed from public live counts, source serialization, or guessed tuple layouts."
    },
    {
      "id": "BC005-06",
      "kind": "integration",
      "text": "Private counters copied from construction and reset only on actual owner replacement support existing TLS preflight; overflow sentinel rejects only opt-in forks, preserving ordinary gameplay."
